# Delivery default (this repo — Route A)

This repository recorded **Route A** (prefer Canon delivery). Follow [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md).

For non-trivial work here: **branch → commits → push → open a PR to `main`** without asking each time (Route A).

**Never merge** a PR unless the human explicitly says to merge (e.g. “merge #12”, “please merge”). “Fix”, “ship”, “land”, “clear open PRs”, or “dogfood” is **not** merge permission — open or update the PR and stop.

Only stop before opening a PR when:

- The human explicitly forbade commit/PR **for this task**, or
- You are blocked (no remote, `gh` missing/unauthed, etc.)

Do not treat local-only work as done. Do not auto-merge or merge because CI is green.

Products that choose **Route B** (ask-before-commit) should not copy this file.
